    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A soul stone is a pre-Cataclysm Shining Star device used as a conduit for transferring soul energy into constructed bodies. Research from Gravestone indicates that souls from Celestial-influenced lineages produced the most effective stones. The stones are not necessarily consumed during transference, though a portion of a soul may pass into a constructed body and result in independent sentience. No portable player-facing mechanical benefit is defined in the available source material.</p>",
